# HATC i18n

- All copy lives in JSON message files under `src/messages/` (`zh-Hant`, `zh-Hans`, `en`).
  `zh-Hant` is the default locale.
- Never hard-code user-facing text in components; always read from messages.
- Reuse keys: identical text must NOT get a new key. Search existing keys first and
  reuse. Only add a key when the string is genuinely new.
- Keep the same key set across all locales; do not let files drift out of sync.
- Use clear, hierarchical keys (e.g. `home.hero.title`), not the literal text as the key.
- Operational links (customer service, contact) come from CMS config, not messages.

## Example

```json
// ❌ BAD: duplicate keys for the same text
{ "home.cta": "聯絡我們", "footer.contactUs": "聯絡我們" }

// ✅ GOOD: one shared key, reused in both places
{ "common.contactUs": "聯絡我們" }
```
